{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0969"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge science/medicine","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/science__medicine.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",72],["-","Doctors"],["+","The"],["=",1],["+","animal's role is that of carriers (vectors): doctors "],["=",4],["-","carriers"],["+","insects"],["=",1],["+","and ticks "],["=",383],["+","\n| Zika fever | Zika virus | Aedes mosquito |"],["=",534],["+","\n\nThe newest member of the family made headlines in 2015 and 2016. The Zika virus, first isolated in 1947 from a rhesus monkey in the Zika Forest of Uganda, spread explosively through Brazil and Latin America. Again Aedes mosquitoes act as its carriers, and an infection during pregnancy can cause microcephaly in the unborn child."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",66],["+","Die Tiere dienen als Überträger (Vektoren): "],["=",6],["-","Überträger"],["+","Insekten"],["=",1],["+","und Zecken "],["=",369],["+","\n| Zika-Fieber | Zika-Virus | Aedes-Mücke |"],["=",514],["+","\n\nDas jüngste Mitglied der Familie machte 2015 und 2016 Schlagzeilen. Das Zika-Virus, 1947 erstmals aus einem Rhesusaffen im Zika Forest in Uganda isoliert, breitete sich explosionsartig in Brasilien und Lateinamerika aus. Wieder dienen Aedes-Mücken als Überträger, und eine Infektion in der Schwangerschaft kann beim ungeborenen Kind eine Mikrozephalie verursachen."]]}]},
